            "review_title": "Review at Ashima 1",
            "review_text": "GoldenPiggies\nSingapore, Singapore77 contributions\n0\nCan skip this restaurant\nDec 2019\nI felt this eatery is not worth a visit due to bad service standards by an older Vietnamese woman in a black uniform. Other young lady staffs were helpful despite of the language barriers we experienced.\nWhen you spend $150-200 for a hotpot meal for a small family in Vietnam, you don't want a staff throws attitude at you just coz you want to double confirm the order. \nAll 4 of us were wondering what's the hype of this eatery on Tripadvisor.\nI'm sure there would be better and nicer restaurants with a lot of vege menu in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2020",
