            "review_text": "昕琪 苏\nUlaanbaatar, Mongolia28 contributions\n0\nMushroom lover should not miss\nNov 2017 • Friends\nWe bumped into this restaurant on our way back to the guesthouse and had our last meal in Hanoi here. The salad made of Chinese caterpillar fungus flowers was a great appetizer. The beef cooked with slices of big mushrooms was great. Though the beef was a bit overcooked, the mushroom soaked in the sauce was amazing. Pity that they didnt have salmon that noon.\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2017",
