            "review_text": "Brian H\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat restaurant\nJun 2015 • Friends\nIf you are interested in tasting a wide range of mushrooms, this is an excellent choice. We ended up having 13 different types of mushrooms cooked at the table in a hotpot. The food and service was outstanding . My only complaint is that the wine list was limited and like most restaurants in Hanoi overpriced. But it's the mushrooms that is the draw not the wine!\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2015",
