            "review_text": "rockyrob\nWestbury, United Kingdom121 contributions\n0\nAshima 1\nJan 2015 • Family\nA new experience for me going to a restaurant that specialises in mushrooms. Service was very good and the waitresses not only bring the food they assist with the cooking and serving of the mushroom dishes. There was also a delicious seaweed salad I would recommend. Very clean and efficient restaurant which I would certainly come back to and try some of their seafood and meat dishes too. Reasonable prices but spect to pay more for seafood and beef. Doorman operates their and assists customers with taxis on entry and departure.\nRead more\nWritten January 24, 2015",
