            "review_text": "Jepa P\nJarvenpaa, Finland262 contributions\n0\nExcellent for mushroom lovers!\nFeb 2014 • Couples\nThe list of mushrooms one can pick for hot pot is stunning. There is also a vegetarian broth for the hot pot. It tasted very good and had goji berries, ginseng root and chinese dates in it. The restaurant is a bit of the formal side but we got served well even though it was very cold outside, and after having felt frozen all day long, we sat in the fancy restaurant with vests and hats on. The staff speaks english well. Very good choice if you happen to love mushrooms. I was sorry I have only one stomach. I would have loved to taste all the 23 varieties...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2014",
